BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 714.3 Tm (grew fastest, while visits to the art gallery changed little.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 689.3 Tm (In 2000 the science museum received 420,000 visitors, slightly more than the art gallery with) Tj ET
